# The storefront image: only what the public site reads, plus what an automatic build needs
# (house rules, templates, skills, workflows). Everything else stays out, above all .env (keys)
# and storefront/ (customers' names and email addresses).
*
!AGENTS.md
!skills
!workflows
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!tsconfig.json
!engine.config.json
!src
!templates
!themes
!avatars
!channels
channels/*
!channels/no-way-really
!out
out/*
!out/no-way-really
